   "id": "clse07:940400",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "橘結衣",
   "speaker_ko": "타치바나 유이",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「待って、乃々姉」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:940500",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "橘結衣",
   "speaker_ko": "타치바나 유이",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「乃々姉には、私と拓留兄の仲をどうこう言う資格はないと思うんだけど」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:940600",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "橘結衣",
   "speaker_ko": "타치바나 유이",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「だって、乃々姉は拓留兄とは⟦rb⟧ただの⟦rt⟧⟦rbc⟧●●●⟦/r⟧⟦rb⟧家族⟦rt⟧⟦rbc⟧●●⟦/r⟧でしょ？ いつも言ってるもんね。だから拓留兄が私たちと何をしようが、関係ないもん」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:940700",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "橘結衣",
   "speaker_ko": "타치바나 유이",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「ふぅん。そうやって脅せば従うって思ってるんでしょ」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:940800",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "橘結衣",
   "speaker_ko": "타치바나 유이",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「いや。拓留兄は私のもんだもん。誰にも渡さないんだから」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:940900",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "橘結衣",
   "speaker_ko": "타치바나 유이",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「拓留兄は黙ってて！」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:941000",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "橘結衣",
   "speaker_ko": "타치바나 유이",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「ユウ……」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:941100",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "橘結衣",
   "speaker_ko": "타치바나 유이",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「分け合う……？」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:941200",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "橘結衣",
   "speaker_ko": "타치바나 유이",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「私も、ユウの意見に賛成かも」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:941300",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "橘結衣",
   "speaker_ko": "타치바나 유이",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「だったら私は頭がいいな」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:941400",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "橘結衣",
   "speaker_ko": "타치바나 유이",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「じゃ、乃々姉お願い……」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:941500",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "橘結衣",
   "speaker_ko": "타치바나 유이",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「せーのっ」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:941600",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "橘結衣",
   "speaker_ko": "타치바나 유이",
   "prev_speaker": null,
